# U-Boot keeps no saved environment on these images. The upstream defconfig
# stores it in the MMC at 0x4000-0x8000, which on this repo's GPT layout is
# the tail of the partition entry array (sectors 2-33): a saveenv would
# corrupt the partition table. boot.scr sets everything the boot needs.
# CONFIG_ENV_IS_IN_MMC is not set
CONFIG_ENV_IS_NOWHERE=y
